,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle had July to August at 60% of normal and August to September at 55%. Grid 25102 had its driest year in 1991 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
